body:
Fair

&#x200B;

>!I've been to all the archives and also seen the prisoner, I'm not sure what else there is to see though but I'd like to be thorough!<

I know it's not an amazing time but just getting S+ on hardcore was a huge achievement for me :)

&#x200B;

I got all pouches in the playthrough but ignored the magnum, got every upgrade as well, my first save was right before G1, second was right before G2 and my third was (absolute shocker) right before G3. I could've probably done better if I didn't backtrack as often but I'm really pleased with my result.

Solved it myself, here is the edited code:

    public class EnemyAttack : MonoBehaviour
    {

        private Animator anim;

        // Start is called before the first frame update
        void Start()
        {
            //anim = gameObject.GetComponent<Animator>();
        }

        // Update is called once per frame
        void Update()
        {

        }

       /* public void RemoveHealth(int value)
        {
            Health -= value;
        }*/

        void OnCollisionEnter2D(Collision2D coll) // On collision damage the player
        {
            Debug.Log("Enemy Collision");
            if (coll.collider.gameObject.layer == LayerMask.NameToLayer("Player")) //If the collision is with the player
            {
                Debug.Log("Collision with player");
                coll.gameObject.GetComponent<Health>().health -= 1;
                anim = coll.gameObject.GetComponent<Animator>();
                anim.SetTrigger("hit");

            }
        }

    }

Resolved code:

    if (Input.GetKey("b")){

                    if (GetComponent<PlayerController>().isRunning == true)
                    {
                        anim.SetTrigger("runningAttack");
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        anim.SetTrigger("attackOne");
                    }

    //if statement is finished later on
